@startuml Pagelas Flow - Clubinho NIB API
!theme plain
hide footbox
title Pagelas — scoped weekly records

actor "Admin / Coordinator / Teacher" as Client
participant PagelasController as Controller
participant "Create / Get / Update / Delete PagelasService" as Service
participant PagelaLaunchWindowService as Week
participant "ClubControlService\n(academic periods)" as Periods
database "MySQL\nPagelasRepository" as Repository

Client -> Controller : list, detail or mutation
Controller -> Service : DTO/query + role access context

opt GET /pagelas/launch-window
  Controller -> Week : current()
  Week -> Periods : active periods of today's year and neighbours
  Week --> Client : open / closed + reason, current academic week
end

alt Create or update
  Service -> Repository : verify child or pagela is within caller reach
  Repository --> Service : allowed or denied
  Service -> Week : resolveForCreation / resolveForUpdate
  Week -> Periods : active periods around today (America/Sao_Paulo)
  alt today outside every active period
    Week --> Client : 400 VAL_4007 ACADEMIC_PERIOD_CLOSED
  else future week, other year, date outside period
    Week --> Client : 400 VAL_4005
  else accepted
    Week --> Service : academic year/week to store
  end
end

Service -> Repository : scoped query, create, update or delete
Repository --> Service : entity/page or not-found
Service --> Client : PagelaResponseDto / shared page / message

note over Week, Repository
  Pagelas are only created or edited inside the academic period;
  deleting is not affected.
  One pagela per child and academic week is database-enforced.
  Out-of-scope records look not found on reads.
end note
@enduml
